    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLAST 'EM UP\u00a0</strong>WITH YOUR PHONE-GUN!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626860/extras/ee651fc7358c7d800b1cc4edabd5d013.poster.avif?t=1755034872\" width=800 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626860/extras/ee651fc7358c7d800b1cc4edabd5d013.webm?t=1755034872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626860/extras/ee651fc7358c7d800b1cc4edabd5d013.mp4?t=1755034872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Protect gloobi is a fast-paced fps where you split your focus between survival, replenishing your ammo by playing the game on your phone and shredding your foes to pieces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across the galaxy to earn currency and buy the perfect combination of weapons to obliterate hordes of hostile aliens! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Travel across the galaxy\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle and shred many kinds of aliens to pieces in a different world each time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be the\u00a0tech king</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obliterate your foes with many kinds of exotic phones and download different apps that change the way you play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don't forget to protect Gloobi</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the simple game on your phone in mid-battle to gain ammo while trying to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626860/extras/76e13fd62324b752fa06a6f4173f4ce7.poster.avif?t=1755034872\" width=800 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626860/extras/76e13fd62324b752fa06a6f4173f4ce7.webm?t=1755034872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626860/extras/76e13fd62324b752fa06a6f4173f4ce7.mp4?t=1755034872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<br><br><br><br></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLAST 'EM UP\u00a0</strong>WITH YOUR PHONE-GUN!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626860/extras/ee651fc7358c7d800b1cc4edabd5d013.poster.avif?t=1755034872\" width=800 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626860/extras/ee651fc7358c7d800b1cc4edabd5d013.webm?t=1755034872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626860/extras/ee651fc7358c7d800b1cc4edabd5d013.mp4?t=1755034872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Protect gloobi is a fast-paced fps where you split your focus between survival, replenishing your ammo by playing the game on your phone and shredding your foes to pieces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across the galaxy to earn currency and buy the perfect combination of weapons to obliterate hordes of hostile aliens! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Travel across the galaxy\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle and shred many kinds of aliens to pieces in a different world each time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be the\u00a0tech king</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obliterate your foes with many kinds of exotic phones and download different apps that change the way you play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don't forget to protect Gloobi</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the simple game on your phone in mid-battle to gain ammo while trying to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626860/extras/76e13fd62324b752fa06a6f4173f4ce7.poster.avif?t=1755034872\" 